+//! Current renderer-selected inputs, owned by one nonserialized page frame.
+//! This is not a source-row lease, descriptor or export permission. A consumer
+//! must separately prove fresh composition, final allocator ownership, immutable
+//! dependent input, current resources, and the actual output representation.
